{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Minami-ke: Okaeri","A year has passed since \"Okawari\" and the 3 sisters have grown up. Their likings and mods are almost the same, Haruka the older sister is a love-giving mother to the younger sisters, but she's also a discipline follower, Kana the middle one leaves everything to the last possible moment and always gives trouble to this trio, and Chiaki the little one is the calculating and manipulating one, she likes to be admired and loved by Haruka and always gives trouble to the less blessed Kana. An unbalanced family, but besides of that they love each other with their whole heart. This family's daily life is as funny as ever, trouble and love is always present, now its time to see if they'll survive this age change since Haruka is now a Young adult and she has even more responsabilities while having to watch over the younger while integrating to the adult life.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["みなみけ おかえり",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":3225,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":14575,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-5162","ids":{"shikimori":5162,"mal":5162,"anilist":5162,"kodik":"serial-23339"},"kodikIds":["serial-7819","serial-23339"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-7819":"2019-12-07T18:24:18Z","serial-23339":"2020-03-04T08:46:24Z"},"title":"Сёстры Минами 3","originalTitle":"Minami-ke Okaeri","alt":"Сёстры Минами Сезон 3 / Minami-ke: Okaeri みなみけ おかえり","description":"Третий сезон сериала о трёх сестричках. С событий второго сезона прошёл год, и девушки уже почти выросли. Однако повседневная жизнь этой семьи так же забавна, как и в прошлом. И не взирая на мелкие ссоры, сёстры живут дружно. Любовь, подростковые проблемы — всё это приходит в их жизнь. Но теперь Харука стала старше и уже не может постоянно присматривать за импульсивной Каной и замкнутой Тиаки , что порождает новые забавные ситуации.","year":2009,"type":"TV","genres":["сэйнэн","Комедия","cgdct","Школа"],"rating":7.55,"popularity":13649,"ongoi